
.subckt astra_078_cmos_filtered_request_arbiter vdd VSS ra rb ga gb
CA ga VSS 100f
CB gb VSS 100f
M1 na ra vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M10 net3 na nb VSS ANMOS l=1u w=100u
M11 ga net2 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M12 ga net2 VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M13 gb net3 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M14 gb net3 VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M2 na nb vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M3 na ra net0 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 net0 nb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M5 nb rb vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M6 nb na vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M7 nb rb net1 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M8 net1 na VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M9 net2 nb na VSS ANMOS l=1u w=100u
RA vdd net2 10k
RB vdd net3 10k
.ends astra_078_cmos_filtered_request_arbiter
